{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tomb of Chacal is a stealth-based horror game set in a long-forgotten tomb. You are an archeologist who has stumbled into this place almost by accident and are now in a fight for your very survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo contains a vertical slice of 4 out of 10 levels from the final game. It showcases the game's puzzle, stealth and horror mechanics as well as providing an introduction to the story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">YOU ARE NOT ALONE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776720/extras/Tomb_of_Chacal_monsters_A__final_.gif?t=1749279211\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dead do not want to be disturbed and there are ancient creatures called &quot;Guardians&quot; that have been sworn to protect this place from all who would trespass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PUZZLES AND EXPLORATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776720/extras/Tomb_of_Chacal_puzzles__final_.gif?t=1749279211\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with different contraptions to make your way through the labyrinth. Collect artifacts to return to the museum - if you can make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DO NOT BE SEEN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776720/extras/Tomb_of_Chacal_monsters_B__final_.gif?t=1749279211\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The guardians here are not omniscient - you will have to use your wits to survive. Find hiding spots to confuse them, or just run away if all else fails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776720?t=1749279211","background_raw":"https://store